OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 8 FEB
OL,4,G0900FSunday Morning
OL,5,     GSarah Walker with three hours of
OL,6,     Gclassical music to reflect,
OL,7,     Grestore and refresh, with a blend
OL,8,     Gof soulful choral music, romantic
OL,9,     Gorchestral classics and lively,
OL,10,     Guplifting piano.
OL,11,G1200FPrivate Passions
OL,12,     GMichael Berkeley's guest is
OL,13,     GRichard Stokes, one of the
OL,14,     Gworld's leading authorities on
OL,15,     GGerman art songs or lieder. He
OL,16,     Ghas also translated many songs
OL,17,     Gand operas.
OL,18,G1330FMusic Map
OL,19,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch traces a path
OL,20,     Gthrough the Andalusian
OL,21,     Gcountryside towards Chabrier's
OL,22,     GEspana.
